<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to firm. Demand was moderate to light. Top $52.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 50.50-52.00, mostly 51.00-51.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.  41.00-45.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs.  44.50-47.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs.  47.00-50.00</p>
</text>
